# The hero clip is rendered from a real recording, and the recording is
# committed so `go run ./internal/render/cmd/hero` regenerates the README's
# image from the repo alone (2026-09-14).
!/assets/hero.tape
# A tape that is a test input, not a run's output (TTP-137, 2026-09-19): the
# old-decode gate reads it, and a clone without it fails the recorder suite.
!/internal/recorder/testdata/no-probe.tape
